%% §21 machine 8 of 8 — Reward  (Prisma enum: RewardState)
%% §21: DRAFT -> ACTIVE -> PAUSED -> EXPIRED / ARCHIVED
    direction TB
    [*] --> DRAFT : reward drafted against a campaign
    DRAFT --> ACTIVE : tokens minted, QR codes live
    ACTIVE --> PAUSED : temporarily withdrawn
    PAUSED --> ACTIVE : resumed (derived)
    ACTIVE --> EXPIRED : expiresAt passes
    PAUSED --> EXPIRED : expiresAt passes
    EXPIRED --> ARCHIVED : retired from reporting
    ARCHIVED --> [*]

    note right of ACTIVE
      The reward's state gates the fan page. A token's
      own history is a separate audit trail of
      SCAN / LANDING / CLAIM / REDEEM events, and
      REDEEM is enforced once-forever by a partial
      unique index — not by application logic.
    end note
